## Configuration

All settings are environment variables with the `PODPOCKET_` prefix.

| Variable | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `PODPOCKET_PUBLIC_URL` | required | Externally reachable base URL. Absolute links in API responses are built from it. |
| `PODPOCKET_DATABASE_URL` | `sqlite+aiosqlite:////data/podpocket.db` | SQLAlchemy database URL. Migrations run on startup. |
| `PODPOCKET_CACHE_DIR` | `/cache` | Where cached artwork is stored. |
| `PODPOCKET_REGION` | `us` | Region used for Discover content. |
| `PODPOCKET_REFRESH_INTERVAL_MINUTES` | `30` | How often the scheduler refreshes subscribed feeds. |
| `PODPOCKET_RUN_SCHEDULER` | `true` | Set to `false` to disable the background feed refresh. |
| `PODPOCKET_ALLOW_PRIVATE_FEEDS` | `false` | By default the server only connects to public IP addresses, checked at connect time. Set to `true` for feeds hosted on your LAN. |
| `PODPOCKET_MAX_FEED_BYTES` | `52428800` | Largest feed document accepted, in bytes. |
| `PODPOCKET_MAX_IMAGE_BYTES` | `20971520` | Largest image accepted, in bytes. |

## Path prefixes

Each prefix replaces one Pocket Casts host, so the app only needs to be pointed at this server.

| Prefix | Replaces |
| --- | --- |
| `/cache` | `cache.pocketcasts.com` |
| `/refresh` | `refresh.pocketcasts.com` |
| `/search` | `search.pocketcasts.com` |
| `/static` | `static.pocketcasts.com` |
{% endblock %}

